# Permission Protocol Receipt Gate Action

Verify a Permission Protocol receipt before deployment. **No receipt = No deploy.**

## Required GitHub Secrets

Add these in your repo at **Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions** before using this action:

| Secret | Required | Where to get it |
|-------|----------|-----------------|
| `PP_ENDPOINT` | Yes | Permission Protocol API base URL. For hosted PP use `https://app.permissionprotocol.com`. |
| `PP_API_KEY` | Yes | Create an API key: [app.permissionprotocol.com/settings/api-keys](https://app.permissionprotocol.com/settings/api-keys) |
| `PP_TENANT_ID` | Yes | Copy your tenant/company ID from dashboard settings: [app.permissionprotocol.com/settings](https://app.permissionprotocol.com/settings) |

If any secret is missing, the action fails with a specific error (for example: `Missing PP_API_KEY. Get one at https://app.permissionprotocol.com/settings/api-keys`).

## Usage

```yaml
- uses: permission-protocol/receipt-gate@v1
